  "about": {
    "zh": {
      "title": "团队简介",
      "html": "<h3>名称</h3>\n<h2>秦罗万象</h2>\n<p>Aethera <em>(/ˈiːθərə/)</em></p>\n<h3>愿景</h3>\n<blockquote><p>秦月照研路，罗星汇万象。</p></blockquote>\n<p>「秦罗万象」是一个由<strong>秦勇（Yong Qin）</strong>与<strong>罗朝广（Chaoguang Luo）</strong>两位学者组成的学术研究团队。团队名取两位学者姓氏首字「秦」「罗」，寓意「秦月照研路，罗星汇万象」——以月光喻治学之沉静照亮，以星罗喻万象之汇聚交融。</p>\n<h3>使命</h3>\n<p>我们以严谨、开放、可复现的方法开展学术研究，聚焦管理与数据科学交叉领域的真实问题，并在此持续记录与分享团队的研究进展与思考。</p>\n<h3>本站</h3>\n<p>本站是「秦罗万象」团队的公开学术窗口，旨在为学者之间的长期协作提供一个稳定、可积累的空间，将分散的研究线索整理为清晰、可回看的脉络，深度发掘管理与数据科学交叉领域的真实问题。</p>\n<p>我们希望在这里持续做三件事：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>记录进展</strong>：按时间沉淀研究问题、阶段性结论与尚未解答的疑问，便于回溯每一步研究过程。</li>\n<li><strong>分享方法</strong>：公开可复现的思路、工具与写作过程，让交流不止停留在结论层面。</li>\n<li><strong>连接同行</strong>：为关注管理与数据科学交叉议题的读者，提供一个可靠、可追溯的接触入口。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>联系</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>秦勇——<a href=\"mailto:yongqin_ahsc@163.com\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">yongqin_ahsc@163.com</a></li>\n<li>罗朝广——<a href=\"mailto:chaoguangluo@outlook.com\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">chaoguangluo@outlook.com</a></li>\n</ul>"
    },
    "en": {
      "title": "About the Group",
      "html": "<h3>Name</h3>\n<h2>AETHERA</h2>\n<p>秦罗万象</p>\n<h3>Vision</h3>\n<blockquote><p>The Qin moon lights the path of inquiry; the Luo stars gather all phenomena. 「秦月照研路，罗星汇万象」</p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>Aethera</strong> is an academic research team formed by two scholars, <strong>Yong Qin (秦勇)</strong> and <strong>Chaoguang Luo (罗朝广)</strong>. The Chinese name 「秦罗万象」 takes the first characters of the two scholars' surnames, evoking the vision above: moonlight as the quiet illumination of scholarship, and a canopy of stars as the gathering of all phenomena.</p>\n<h3>Mission</h3>\n<p>We pursue rigorous, open, and reproducible research on real-world questions at the intersection of management and data science, and maintain this site as a cumulative record of our progress and reflections.</p>\n<h3>Site</h3>\n<p>This site is the public academic window of Aethera, designed to give scholarly collaboration a stable, cumulative space where scattered research threads are organised into a clear, revisitable trail and the real questions at the intersection of management and data science are explored in depth.</p>\n<p>We try to keep doing three things here:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Record progress</strong>: keep research questions, interim findings and open problems in a time-ordered archive, so that each step can be examined later.</li>\n<li><strong>Share methods</strong>: make reproducible ideas, tools and the writing process visible, not only the conclusions.</li>\n<li><strong>Connect</strong>: offer a reliable, traceable entry point for readers interested in the intersection of management and data science.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Contact</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Yong Qin — <a href=\"mailto:yongqin_ahsc@163.com\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">yongqin_ahsc@163.com</a></li>\n<li>Chaoguang Luo — <a href=\"mailto:chaoguangluo@outlook.com\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">chaoguangluo@outlook.com</a></li>\n</ul>"
    }
  },
